    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even the small steps feel pointless. like i'm just patching a sinking boat. no matter how many times i try to change, the same darkness just comes back. it's not even about a \"change\" anymore, it's more like... what's even the point of the struggle if the result is always the same? it just feels like a waste of energy at this point.",
